From: Howard Hsu <howard-yh.hsu@mediatek.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jun 2022 11:15:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7915: add vendor commands

nl80211 vendor command interface for mt7915: EDCCA control (enable,
thresholds, compensation; re-applied on every channel change) and the
available BSS color bitmap query used by hostapd for color selection.

Squash of the following MediaTek commits:
- wifi: mt76: mt7915: add vendor subcmd EDCCA ctrl
  enable/threshold/compensation (Howard Hsu, 2022-06-24)
- wifi: mt76: mt7915: add vendor cmd to get available color bitmap
  (Yi-Chia Hsieh, 2023-01-26)
